                  %em Point-free Construction of Real Exponentiation
                %strong 18
                3 (2022) &amp;lbrack;
                %a{:href => "https://doi.org/10.46298/lmcs-18%283%3A15%292022"}> doi:10.46298/lmcs-18(3:15)2022
                ,
